# The tree is LF everywhere: Go sources, the Dockerfile the image is built from,
# the ignore files, and the embedded web bundle.
#
# Windows checkouts would otherwise rewrite all of it to CRLF, because
# core.autocrlf defaults to true there. That shows up as diff churn, makes the
# committed bundle differ from the one that was tested, and can put a stray \r
# into anything a build reads.
* text=auto eol=lf
